\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 \b Selection and HUD\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}With nothing selected, hover preview of unit/object under cursor instead of \'93no selection\'94.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Unify mouse and keyboard cursor: mouse moves cursor; keyboard moves same cursor when mouse idle.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Right HUD: current biome, selected unit(s), all entities on current tile. Resources stay top, controls bottom.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Selected unit display should be a small ASCII portrait, not a generic box.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Slight zoom so units/objects are easier to see and select.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}HUD should update on hover (not just click/space).\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Cursor/caret needs an indicator when an action has been issued on a unit.\
\
\b Controls and commands\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\'93Resign\'94 leaves the current game; \'93Exit\'94 closes the application.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Building stays selected after training so more can be queued.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}P is overloaded (peasant + pause). Once in training mode, P should queue peasants; pause uses a separate key.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Escape should always cancel current mode if stuck.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Drag-selection unreliable or not working \'97 needs to multi-select properly.\
\
\b Colours, legend, readability\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Clear colour key: units, neutral, enemies, resources, danger markers.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Explain red \'91!\'92 and other symbols (can indicate real threats).\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Enemy peasants should NOT share player\'92s cyan.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sheep should use the neutral animal palette like other Gaia.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Resources/landmarks more visually distinct from neutral elements.\
\
\b Spawning and balance\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Starting positions need safety checks. Peasants can spawn near boars / enemy units / enemy base and die instantly.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Enemy should not start with militia next to player\'92s TC.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Ideally neither side starts with early militia if it creates immediate rush losses.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Boars too dangerous early \'97 reduce strength / aggression / proximity.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Boars should target units, not buildings. (already true)\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sheep / fast animals may need slower movement or longer idle pauses.\
\
\b Player feedback\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Visual action marker when a task is assigned.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Make dangerous situations clearer before they cause instant loss.\
\
\b Build / platform\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Native Windows build so it can run without WSL / repeated passwords.\
\
\b Bugs (stressed: repeated plays)\b0\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Major glitches with control of enemy units being possible.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Broken placement on maps.\
